130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 29 0 R
/E (We have completed the initial annotation and benchmark case construction using public 3D datasets, including ScanNet++ and ARKitScenes, which provide registered RGB-D observations, camera poses, and metric scene geometry. In parallel, we are generating additional simulated benchmark data in Unreal Engine 5 to support controlled trajectories and richer evaluation scenarios. The annotated public cases are now being used by our project supervisor, Dongyue, to evaluate existing video world models under the WorldAnchor protocol. These efforts establish the first end-to-end evaluation pipeline for the project, with a paper submission targeted for September 2026.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [109]
>>
endobj
